  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kigali HFC Implementation Plan (stage I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the 90th meeting of the Executive Committee of the Multilateral Fund for the implementation of the Montreal Protocol, the preparation of the Kigali Implementation Plan for Togo was approved. The project preparation will support the development of an overarching strategy for the HFC phase-down in Togo in addition to a nationwide survey and data collection on the consumption of HFC consumption, analysis of the use of HFCs and alternatives, including import and export statistics for ODS alternatives.</narrative>
  </description>
